  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Pollachius</strong>&nbsp;是一款充满活力、几何风格的 8x8 材质包，为您的 Minecraft 世界带来简洁的方块美学。</span><br><br>凭借其网格状设计和对方块的强调，Pollachius 为 Minecraft 的常规外观带来耳目一新的变化。<br><br>基于 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flospec.com%252fpalette-list%252faap-64\" rel=\"nofollow\">AAP-64</a>&nbsp;调色板，Pollachius 拥有大胆而鲜艳的视觉风格，必定让您的 Minecraft 世界脱颖而出。无论您是探索新生物群系、建造复杂建筑，还是单纯享受游戏美景，Pollachius 都是一款有趣且令人愉悦的材质包，为您的体验增添类似塑料的风格。立即尝试 Pollachius，看看它如何改变您的 Minecraft 世界！<br><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hdVJtusjen\" rel=\"nofollow\">&gt; 分享您的截图！ &lt;</a></div><p style=\"text-align:left\"><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fadfoc.us%252f70212481724168\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载 Java 版 1.6-1.8</a><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fpollachius-bedrock-edition%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">下载基岩版</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9gF9v6f.png\" width=\"1142\" height=\"627\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">欢迎提出任何反馈或建议！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/eB5pPrX\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f3uKLZdT\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://imgur.com/eB5pPrX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>链接：</strong></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/plana-pollachius/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Plana Pollachius</strong></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/resource-packs/3098705-8x-pollachius-an-8x8-simple-pack-with-a-vibrant\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fpollachiu